Hi {Owner},

I build simple websites for lawn care companies around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews about reliability, but no site comes up where someone can see your mowing prices and sign up.

So I built a small sample first: mowing plans by lot size, an online sign-up with gate code and route day, and spring and fall cleanup booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Ten minutes on the phone this week?

